  thing that you can  do  for your future self is to actually pick  up one of these things these are like  habit forming activities and actually  make a habit out of them by sustaining  them this is very very important it is  very easy to read just one off book it  is very easy to write  a diary for a few days and then give up  on it  it is very easy to just go out and meet  a friend  just for the cake of it  but to make a habit out of each of these  things that require sustained  conscious effort on your part  okay it requires absolutely conscious  and sustained effort sustained means  carried over  week after week day after day  okay so unless  you  are very conscious about it very serious  about it it's not going to help you it's  not going to form a habit and you're not  going to get the benefit out of it and  my my hope is that  once you pick up maybe one or two of  these habits over the course of this  short summer vacation you are going to  continue  uh  being involved with this activity with  this habit uh over the course of the  next few years  and then maybe this will be a key  ingredient to your future success so  just like  that earlier comment section of that of  that earlier video in november 2021 was  filled with hope i want to end this  video on this  on this  note of hopefulness and good cheer and  all the very best to you  all of you for your final tests and  assignments and  wrapping up of the first year all the  very best
 

